# Network values are deliberately blank. Set the actual values in the deployment environment.
# OPTIONAL. Own encrypted DATA archive engine, not self-executing code packing.
# No VMProtect/dependency/server-side compiler is needed for this engine.
# Generate the 32-byte key explicitly on the server, outside source checkout:
#   node tools/artifacts/peace.custom-package.js keygen /data/custom-package.key
# Existing key files are never overwritten. Back up the key outside the app.
# Unix: key file must have no group/other permissions. Windows: verify ACLs.
GAME_CUSTOM_PACKAGE_KEY_FILE=/data/custom-package.key
# SOURCE archive needs the actual Railway tree AND matching source
# manifest on the server. Deploying only Relay Server cannot provide missing sources.
# A/B/O archive uses registered artifact bytes. It does not alter active releases.
